{
 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (FAMILY_MEMBER): Sorry we're late, err, the tram just sat there at Flinders Street.",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (DOCTOR): No worries at all, you're here, come and sit yourselves down.",
  "[SEG0003] person_3 (PATIENT): Thanks.",
  "[SEG0004] person_2 (DOCTOR): How's uni been? You were flat out with exams last time I saw you.",
  "[SEG0005] person_3 (PATIENT): Finished.",
  "[SEG0006] person_1 (FAMILY_MEMBER): She graduated in November. We're a bit proud, aren't we.",
  "[SEG0007] person_2 (DOCTOR): Oh that's lovely. Umm, so what can I do for you today?",
  "[SEG0008] person_3 (PATIENT): Contraception.",
  "[SEG0009] person_2 (DOCTOR): Alright. What sort of thing have you been thinking about?",
  "[SEG0010] person_3 (PATIENT): The pill.",
  "[SEG0011] person_1 (FAMILY_MEMBER): She wants something, but the last one gave her shocking headaches.",
  "[SEG0012] person_2 (DOCTOR): Oh, which pill was that? Do you remember the name?",
  "[SEG0013] person_3 (PATIENT): Dunno.",
  "[SEG0014] person_1 (FAMILY_MEMBER): It was levlin. Little yellow packet.",
  "[SEG0015] person_2 (DOCTOR): Levlen, yeah. You were taking one tablet by mouth each day for contraception, and you've stopped it?",
  "[SEG0016] person_3 (PATIENT): Yeah.",
  "[SEG0017] person_2 (DOCTOR): And those headaches, are they still hanging about, or did they go once you stopped?",
  "[SEG0018] person_3 (PATIENT): Gone.",
  "[SEG0019] person_2 (DOCTOR): When did you actually stop it, roughly?",
  "[SEG0020] person_3 (PATIENT): Dunno.",
  "[SEG0021] person_1 (FAMILY_MEMBER): I thought it was last winter.",
  "[SEG0022] person_3 (PATIENT): Or the one before.",
  "[SEG0023] person_2 (DOCTOR): Right, so we can't pin the month. That's fine. Any other tablet since?",
  "[SEG0024] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0025] person_2 (DOCTOR): Anything at all from the chemist, vitamins, whatever?",
  "[SEG0026] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0027] person_2 (DOCTOR): And allergies, medicines or anything else that sets you off?",
  "[SEG0028] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0029] person_2 (DOCTOR): Do you smoke at all?",
  "[SEG0030] person_3 (PATIENT): Sometimes.",
  "[SEG0031] person_1 (FAMILY_MEMBER): Weekends, love. A few of a Saturday night.",
  "[SEG0032] person_2 (DOCTOR): So not every day, just a few on the weekend. What about alcohol?",
  "[SEG0033] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0034] person_2 (DOCTOR): Any chance you could be pregnant just now?",
  "[SEG0035] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0036] person_2 (DOCTOR): And your periods, are they turning up regularly?",
  "[SEG0037] person_3 (PATIENT): Yeah.",
  "[SEG0038] person_2 (DOCTOR): With those old headaches, any flashing lights, or weakness?",
  "[SEG0039] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0040] person_2 (DOCTOR): Any chest pain, or swelling in the calf?",
  "[SEG0041] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0042] person_2 (DOCTOR): I'll just do your blood pressure. One eighteen over seventy two. That's a nice number.",
  "[SEG0043] person_2 (DOCTOR): Those headaches were probably from the oestrogen in the combined pill. With the smoking as well, I'd rather not start you on another combined one.",
  "[SEG0044] person_3 (PATIENT): Okay.",
  "[SEG0045] person_2 (DOCTOR): So we could look at, umm, the mini pill, or a hormonal coil, or the implant. Implanon. It sits in the arm, lasts three years.",
  "[SEG0046] person_3 (PATIENT): Implant.",
  "[SEG0047] person_1 (FAMILY_MEMBER): She's been keen on that.",
  "[SEG0048] person_2 (DOCTOR): Here's the Implanon leaflet, have a read at home. We won't lock anything in today.",
  "[SEG0049] person_2 (DOCTOR): Pop back in a fortnight and we'll go with whatever you've settled on. If those headaches ever come roaring back we might organise a scan, but not now."
 ],
